\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces System architecture. The learner application records audio and, if the user switches it on, computes lip features in the browser (no camera picture is stored or sent). The scoring package checks recording quality and follows one of three routes according to the task. The researcher/teacher application reads the same recordings and scores. Dashed arrows: data written to the local machine.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{2}{System architecture. The learner application records audio and, if the user switches it on, computes lip features in the browser (no camera picture is stored or sent). The scoring package checks recording quality and follows one of three routes according to the task. The researcher/teacher application reads the same recordings and scores. Dashed arrows: data written to the local machine}{figure.caption.1}{}}
